{"schemaVersion":1,"id":304,"sections":[{"id":"607002-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20503],"start":0,"count":15},{"id":"607002-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20504],"start":15,"count":9}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607002-PROLOGUE:20503:1","scriptId":20503,"text":"围绕着信号旗的搜寻活动正在火热进行中——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":475,"speaker":"达克妮·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-PROLOGUE:20503:2","scriptId":20503,"text":"“快看快看，我又发现了新的信号旗。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":475,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":460,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-PROLOGUE:20503:3","scriptId":20503,"text":"“干得还不错嘛，放进来吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":475,"right":460,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607002-PROLOGUE:20503:4","scriptId":20503,"text":"雷思丽指了指她身边的那个大箱子，里面已经放了不少信号旗。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":475,"right":460,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":475,"speaker":"达克妮·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-PROLOGUE:20503:5","scriptId":20503,"text":"“你这是第几面旗了？我可是已经发现6面。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":475,"right":460,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":460,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-PROLOGUE:20503:6","scriptId":20503,"text":"“不巧，我已经是第7面了～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":475,"right":460,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":440,"speaker":"瓦什蒂·布雷德利","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-PROLOGUE:20503:7","scriptId":20503,"text":"“收集差不多的话，先去换成资源吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":440,"right":460,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607002-PROLOGUE:20503:8","scriptId":20503,"text":"是队长瓦什蒂，她还坐在树荫下悠哉地看着小说。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":440,"right":460,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":475,"speaker":"达克妮·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-PROLOGUE:20503:9","scriptId":20503,"text":"“I、R在这里……O……哦～！？这个已经凑齐了！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":475,"right":460,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":460,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-PROLOGUE:20503:10","scriptId":20503,"text":"“这附近目前还没发现其他小队，我觉得还可以再找找。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":475,"right":460,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":440,"speaker":"瓦什蒂·布雷德利","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-PROLOGUE:20503:11","scriptId":20503,"text":"“那你们继续吧……我留在这里看守箱子。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":440,"right":460,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":460,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-PROLOGUE:20503:12","scriptId":20503,"text":"“好吧，如果我们发现其他队伍的踪迹就会回来和你汇合。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":440,"right":460,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":440,"speaker":"瓦什蒂·布雷德利","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-PROLOGUE:20503:13","scriptId":20503,"text":"“好……去吧去吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":440,"right":460,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":460,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-PROLOGUE:20503:14","scriptId":20503,"text":"“队长你可不要看书看入迷把信号旗给弄丢了啊，这次任务如果做得好绝对可以挽回我们小队的声誉。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":440,"right":460,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607002-PROLOGUE:20503:15","scriptId":20503,"text":"临走前，雷思丽不忘叮嘱瓦什蒂，但无奈的是对方只是摆摆手并没有听进去的样子。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":440,"right":460,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":460,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-EPILOGUE:20504:1","scriptId":20504,"text":"“切，果然还是失败了嘛……有这么个不中用的队长真是倒霉。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":440,"right":460,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607002-EPILOGUE:20504:2","scriptId":20504,"text":"听到炮声急忙赶回来的雷思丽和达克妮最终也没能守住信号旗，大部分的旗帜都被另一支小队的钢舞姬给夺去了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":440,"right":460,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":445,"speaker":"瓦什蒂·布雷德利","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-EPILOGUE:20504:3","scriptId":20504,"text":"“对不起……我的错。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":445,"right":460,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":475,"speaker":"达克妮·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-EPILOGUE:20504:4","scriptId":20504,"text":"“嘿嘿～虽然大部分的信号旗都丢了，但是我手里还有一套哟～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":445,"right":475,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607002-EPILOGUE:20504:5","scriptId":20504,"text":"说着达克妮从背包里拿出了四面信号旗——Ｉ、Ｒ、Ｏ、Ｎ","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":445,"right":475,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":460,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-EPILOGUE:20504:6","scriptId":20504,"text":"“嗯？？没想到达克妮你还有立功的时候啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":460,"right":475,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":475,"speaker":"达克妮·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-EPILOGUE:20504:7","scriptId":20504,"text":"“哼哼～先去把这几面兑换掉吧，省得又被队长弄丢了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":460,"right":475,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":445,"speaker":"瓦什蒂·布雷德利","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-EPILOGUE:20504:8","scriptId":20504,"text":"“呜……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":445,"right":475,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":460,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607002-EPILOGUE:20504:9","scriptId":20504,"text":"“说得对，先把能换的换了，与其被别人抢去还不如踏踏实实一点点回收。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":460,"right":475,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
